# Repo-root .dockerignore. Every service's Dockerfile now builds with the
# repo root as context (each needs the sibling oura-common/ shared source
# tree), so this replaces what used to be a per-service .dockerignore.

**/.git
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.benchmarks
**/.VSCodeCounter

**/tests
**/helm
**/scratchpad
**/htmlcov
**/.coverage

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/README.md
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
